       writes to 0 (0xc0000005 at 0x423ce8c after "Too few players"). Hook 0x423ce71 -> cave 0x56eb000 (text padding):
       end >= cap skips the entry (jmp to the per-player cleanup 0x423b41b), else the original 3 instructions.
